								<wikidot:authorUserId>1324229</wikidot:authorUserId>				<content:encoded>
					<![CDATA[
						 <p>There is a lot to like in this article, but the thing I appreciate most is the relatively minor fact that AWCY? is not just &quot;pretentious hipster douchebag wizards.&quot; They just want to make a statement about things, however that ends up shaking out.</p> <p>I also like the ending a great deal, which is something that I almost never say with GoI format stuff.</p> <p>e: Also the Fifthist stuff, Metal's enthusiasm for everything, and the fact that you turned a not-nice thing into a nice thing. Easy +1</p> 
				 	]]>
				</content:encoded>							</item>
					<item>
				<guid>http://www.scpwiki.com/forum/t-2753275#post-3220014</guid>
				<title>Author&#039;s Post</title>
				<link>http://www.scpwiki.com/forum/t-2753275/the-skylarking-gala#post-3220014</link>
				<description></description>
				<pubDate>Fri, 14 Jul 2017 00:20:04 +0000</pubDate>
				<wikidot:authorName>Decibelles</wikidot:authorName>				<wikidot:authorUserId>2005044</wikidot:authorUserId>				<content:encoded>
					<![CDATA[
						 <p>I've had this idea for months and months now, but I had no idea how to write it until a couple months ago where it clicked for me. So fuck yeah.</p> <p>Thanks to:</p> <ul> <li><span class="printuser avatarhover"><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/gaffney" ><img class="small" src="http://www.wikidot.com/avatar.php?userid=1324229&amp;amp;size=small&amp;amp;timestamp=1516572523" alt="Gaffney" style="background-image:url(http://www.wikidot.com/userkarma.php?u=1324229)" /></a><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/gaffney" >Gaffney</a></span> for his feedback and pointing out many things that made the article better.</li> <li><span class="printuser avatarhover"><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/silberescher" ><img class="small" src="http://www.wikidot.com/avatar.php?userid=304355&amp;amp;size=small&amp;amp;timestamp=1516572523" alt="Silberescher" style="background-image:url(http://www.wikidot.com/userkarma.php?u=304355)" /></a><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/silberescher" >Silberescher</a></span> for inspiring me to make this through his Black Queen and Fifthist stuff, as well as general critique.</li> <li><span class="printuser avatarhover"><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/psul" ><img class="small" src="http://www.wikidot.com/avatar.php?userid=2156983&amp;amp;size=small&amp;amp;timestamp=1516572523" alt="psul" style="background-image:url(http://www.wikidot.com/userkarma.php?u=2156983)" /></a><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/psul" >psul</a></span> for writing a certain thing that sparked the inspiration inside me to write this thing.</li> <li><span class="printuser avatarhover"><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/djkaktus" ><img class="small" src="http://www.wikidot.com/avatar.php?userid=1888434&amp;amp;size=small&amp;amp;timestamp=1516572523" alt="djkaktus" style="background-image:url(http://www.wikidot.com/userkarma.php?u=1888434)" /></a><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/djkaktus" >djkaktus</a></span>, <span class="printuser avatarhover"><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/soullesssingularity" ><img class="small" src="http://www.wikidot.com/avatar.php?userid=637830&amp;amp;size=small&amp;amp;timestamp=1516572523" alt="SoullessSingularity" style="background-image:url(http://www.wikidot.com/userkarma.php?u=637830)" /></a><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/soullesssingularity" >SoullessSingularity</a></span>, and Faminepulse for writing the Fifthist stuff for the GoI Contest.</li> <li><span class="printuser avatarhover"><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/taffeta" ><img class="small" src="http://www.wikidot.com/avatar.php?userid=2221240&amp;amp;size=small&amp;amp;timestamp=1516572523" alt="Taffeta" style="background-image:url(http://www.wikidot.com/userkarma.php?u=2221240)" /></a><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/taffeta" >Taffeta</a></span>, <span class="printuser avatarhover"><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/9volt" ><img class="small" src="http://www.wikidot.com/avatar.php?userid=2800867&amp;amp;size=small&amp;amp;timestamp=1516572523" alt="9Volt" style="background-image:url(http://www.wikidot.com/userkarma.php?u=2800867)" /></a><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/9volt" >9Volt</a></span>, and <span class="printuser avatarhover"><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/lordstonefish" ><img class="small" src="http://www.wikidot.com/avatar.php?userid=2527320&amp;amp;size=small&amp;amp;timestamp=1516572523" alt="LordStonefish" style="background-image:url(http://www.wikidot.com/userkarma.php?u=2527320)" /></a><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/lordstonefish" >LordStonefish</a></span> for liking it.</li> </ul> <p>Music I listened to while writing: <a href="https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=85J91FwPrTw">XTC's Skylarking</a>, <a href="https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=qhRNVyJ4jGo">Robert Ashley's The Park</a>.</p> <p>EDIT: If anyone is curious what Skylarking means:</p> <blockquote> <p>The title was chosen as a double entendre, referring to a type of bird (skylark), as well as the British navy term &quot;skylarking&quot;, which means &quot;fooling around&quot;</p> </blockquote> 
				 	]]>
